（Algebra）》第<REF_0002>节。\n我们将在这个空间上赋予一个环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0004>，使所得的对<MATH_0005>成为概形（scheme）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n回顾一下，<MATH_0006>有一个基（basis），由开集（sets）<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>构成。我们称这些开集为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准开集（standard opens）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，见《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0003>节。即使没有明确说明，这一术语也总是蕴含<MATH_0010>是齐次（homogeneous）的，且次数（degree）为正。此外，两个标准开集（standard opens）的交（intersection）仍是这种开集，即<MATH_0011>，其中<MATH_0012>是齐次（homogeneous）的，且次数（degree）为正。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b786ba204a05d2cf196a51022a93798bc96ab9ecfc0011ca93fc6d1776933cdb", "unit_id": "tag:01M3:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本节进行 Proj 构造的对象", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "段落起首所设的环", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "与所设的环相关联的空间", "source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"context": "拓扑空间构造所引的章名", "source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "赋予该空间的层", "source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"context": "所得的对构成的对象", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "由所列开集构成的拓扑基", "source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"context": "此处指构成该基的开集", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集"}, {"context": "对所列基开集的命名", "source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"context": "标准开集所引的章名", "source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "使用标准开集这一术语时隐含的条件之一", "source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"context": "使用标准开集这一术语时隐含的量为正", "source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"context": "此处涉及取交的两个开集", "source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"context": "两个标准开集的集合运算", "source_term": "intersection", "target_term": "交"}, {"context": "描述交集时对相应元素的条件之一", "source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"context": "描述交集时相应元素的这一量为正", "source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}]}
